---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const links = [
  { href: "/about/", label: "소개" },
  { href: "/privacy/", label: "개인정보처리방침" },
  { href: "/contact/", label: "문의" },
];
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-8">
    <p class="text-lg font-extrabold text-primary">Zepio</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">
      로그인도 설치도 없이, 신박한 웹게임을 브라우저에서 바로 즐기세요.
    </p>
    <nav aria-label="사이트 정보" class="mt-4">
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-sm font-semibold">
        {
          links.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href} class="text-slate-700 underline hover:text-primary">
                {link.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-600">© {year} Zepio</p>
  </div>
</footer>